ages": [{"width": 2048, "heightRatio": 66, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTJ3eUSXsAAgRjx.jpg", "height": 1366}], "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 376, "created": 1790437944000, "id": "2103875344105410885", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1903875117375188992/VLcS8Qpi_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Ryan Williams \ud83c\udde8\ud83c\udde6 | The Competition Guy", "username": "Ryan_r_Williams"}, "content": "Canada\u2019s first F-35 flew Wednesday from Texas, the first new Canadian-marked fighter in 44 years. Ottawa said little. \n\nThat same day, Mark Carney told the NYT Canada prepared for U.S. military action.\n\nProbably the stupidest day in Canadian politics in 44 years.", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 10164}}, "post_flair_text": "BE\u00a0\u00a0RETARDED", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATVQwwnq7", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 42, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "rally", "id": 8858923, "raw_content": "What do you think MSNDC and other Democrat media are going to say?\n\n> Trump is annihilating us! The economy is actually doing really well! Record high stock market. Record high median household income. Crude oil is actually low and will go even lower after Trump finishes off Iran, in a necessary and justified war. The democrats have nothing to run on! We are a just bunch of foreigner losers trying to invade your country!\n\nObviously not. The last dying breath of the Democrats is to gaslight you and make you think Trump has done a bunch of stupid shit, alienating everyone except his \u201ccult.\u201d\n\nOf course they are going to say all the polls show a BLUE WAVE.\n\nOf course they are going to say Trump\u2019s approval rating is RECORD LOW.\n\nWhat else would you expect from a dying creature with its back against the wall? Did you expect Sm\u00e9agol to admit he was a liar all along and just give up? \n\nThe midterms are going very well. Republicans have a huge cash advantage. Honest pollsters show there\u2019s about a 50/50 shot we win.\n\nA 50/50 shot is incredible. Only 2 times in the last century has the incumbent party won the midterms. \n\nAll it will take is a reasonable amount of turnout from Trump\u2019s base and the DNC is fucked for the foreseeable future. If we win the midterms, we will further secure our elections, and 8 more years of Vance is practically guaranteed. \n\nThings are looking terrible for democrats, this is their last ditch attempt at Japanese banzai attack. We have been crushing the Japs, we are nearing Tokyo, and now they\u2019re charging our machine guns with bayonets, screaming like insane fucking retards.\n\nThe only reason you don\u2019t see that is because democrats are trying to gaslight you to hide their failure and desperation. ", "author": "EnforceRuleOne", "created": 1790542593044, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "EnforceRuleOne", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "MAGA is close to putting its foot on the DNC\u2019s neck.", "last_comment_created": 1790547760573, "content": "<p>What do you think MSNDC and other Democrat media are going to say?</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Trump is annihilating us! The economy is actually doing really well! Record high stock market. Record high median household income. Crude oil is actually low and will go even lower after Trump finishes off Iran, in a necessary and justified war. The democrats have nothing to run on! We are a just bunch of foreigner losers trying to invade your country!</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Obviously not. The last dying breath of the Democrats is to gaslight you and make you think Trump has done a bunch of stupid shit, alienating everyone except his \u201ccult.\u201d</p>\n<p>Of course they are going to say all the polls show a BLUE WAVE.</p>\n<p>Of course they are going to say Trump\u2019s approval rating is RECORD LOW.</p>\n<p>What else would you expect from a dying creature with its back against the wall? Did you expect Sm\u00e9agol to admit he was a liar all along and just give up?</p>\n<p>The midterms are going very well. Republicans have a huge cash advantage. Honest pollsters show there\u2019s about a 50/50 shot we win.</p>\n<p>A 50/50 shot is incredible. Only 2 times in the last century has the incumbent party won the midterms.</p>\n<p>All it will take is a reasonable amount of turnout from Trump\u2019s base and the DNC is fucked for the foreseeable future. If we win the midterms, we will further secure our elections, and 8 more years of Vance is practically guaranteed.</p>\n<p>Things are looking terrible for democrats, this is their last ditch attempt at Japanese banzai attack. We have been crushing the Japs, we are nearing Tokyo, and now they\u2019re charging our machine guns with bayonets, screaming like insane fucking retards.</p>\n<p>The only reason you don\u2019t see that is because democrats are trying to gaslight you to hide their failure and desperation.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 4, "score_up": 42, "is_edited": true, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "\ud83c\udfc6\u00a0CANT STOP\u00a0\u00a0WINNING\u00a0\u00a0\ud83c\udfc6", "archive_id": ""}], "status": true}